Modifications made by Query Farm LLC relative to the upstream project:

  - Go module path renamed from github.com/duckdb/duckdb-go/v2 to
    github.com/Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn-go/v2 (and all import paths, including
    the mapping and arrowmapping subpackages).
  - Dependency switched from github.com/duckdb/duckdb-go-bindings to
    github.com/Query-farm-haybarn/haybarn-go-bindings, which links the Haybarn
    engine (Haybarn extension trust root + haybarn-extensions.query.farm
    repositories) rather than DuckDB's.
  - The database/sql driver is registered under "haybarn" (preferred) and
    "duckdb" (drop-in alias). The Go package name remains `duckdb` and the
    internal "duckdb_api" config string is preserved for ABI compatibility.
  - Documentation, examples, the user-facing bug-report URL, and CI repointed at
    the Haybarn org.
